    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d256">

                <pb facs="0604" n="508" xml:id="pg508"/>

                <head>No. 234.<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Sir Edward Thornton to Mr.
                    Seward.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Newburyport</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1879-09-08"><hi rendition="#italic">September</hi> 8, 1879</date>.
                        (Received September 9.)</dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: With reference to your note of the 3d of
                    July last, relating to the invasion of United States territory by British
                    Indians, I have the honor to inclose copy of a report of a committee of the
                    privy council for Canada, which has been forwarded to me by the governor-general
                    of Canada, and which contains the views of the Canadian Government upon that
                    subject.</p>
                <p>I have the honor, &amp;c.,</p>
                <closer><signed>EDW’D THORNTON.</signed></closer>


                <xi:include href="d256-a1.xml" xpointer="d256-a1"/>
            </div>
        </body>
